% One Bolt (resource scarcity: a mana budget)
%
% A flooded chapel. In the hall stands a sentry drone, by an open shaft;
% past it, in the flooded nave, squats the pump engine - a heavy machine,
% soaked. Both must go. Everyone has 2 mana, and a lightning flash costs 2:
% whoever holds it gets ONE bolt. A bolt strikes everyone in one area.
%
%   porch (team) --- hall (drone; the shaft) --- nave (engine; flooded)
%     |               ~gap~
%   gallery ---------'          (a balcony over the hall)
%
% The engine is wet: the bolt kills it. The drone is dry: a bolt only
% stuns it. So either the one bolt meets the drone soaked, in the engine's
% area, or the drone goes some other way first.
%
% Methods:
%   the flood   bring the drone into the flooded nave - hook it in from
%               the nave, or taunt it from there (it walks in after the
%               taunter); it arrives soaked, and one bolt on the nave
%               takes both machines (hook, taunt + lightningFlash)
%   the drop    knock the drone into the shaft - a fireball or a shield
%               bash from the porch, a wave in the hall, a vortex on the
%               shaft - or hook it off the hall from the gallery, across
%               the gap; then the bolt on the engine alone
%
% Traps (each spends the only bolt, or wastes the soak):
%   - jolting before the drone is soaked: it is only stunned, and the mana
%     is gone;
%   - soaking the drone where it stands (a wave in the hall): it is wet,
%     but in the hall - the bolt on the nave does not reach it, and the
%     bolt on the hall does not reach the engine;
%   - a taunt from the gallery: the drone walks round to the gallery, dry.
%
% Hypothesis (design.md): no single skill wins; every winning pair holds
% the flash, and the partner decides the method; every winning plan casts
% exactly one bolt.

% === Map: four areas; the balcony looks over the hall across a gap ===
region(porch).
region(gallery).
region(hall).
region(nave).
connected(porch, hall).
connected(porch, gallery).
connected(hall, nave).
gap(gallery, hall).
lineOfSight(porch, hall).
lineOfSight(gallery, hall).
lineOfSight(hall, nave).
lineOfSight(nave, hall).

feature(hall, shaft, chasm).
onEnter(nave, puddle).

% === Companions ===
role(player, player).
role(mage, companion).
at(player, porch).
at(mage, porch).
mana(player, 2).
mana(mage, 2).

% === Machines ===
role(drone, enemy).
at(drone, hall).
tag(drone, machine).

role(engine, enemy).
at(engine, nave).
tag(engine, machine).
tag(engine, heavy).
tag(engine, wet).

% === Default kit: one skill each (combos replans the whole matrix) ===
knows(player, hook).
knows(mage, lightningFlash).

% === Victory ===
% The drone is brought to the engine and one bolt takes both; or each
% machine goes on its own.
win :- if(), do(bringTo(drone, nave, none), neutralize(engine), confirmStopped(drone)).
win :- if(), do(neutralize(drone), neutralize(engine)).

funBlocker(drone).
funBlocker(engine).
funBlockerGoal(drone, neutralize(drone)).
funBlockerGoal(engine, neutralize(engine)).
funExpect(single_actor_plans, atMost, 0).

% === Choice: one skill each, from seven (htn_components combos) ===
comboSeat(player, 1).
comboSeat(mage, 1).
comboPool(lightningFlash).
comboPool(hook).
comboPool(taunt).
comboPool(fireball).
comboPool(tidalWave).
comboPool(shieldBash).
comboPool(vortex).
comboMinWins(10).
comboMinMethods(5).

goals(win).
